<title>USA: U.S. soymeal weekly export sales highlights--USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. soymeal weekly export sales highlights--USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. soybean meal major sales activity in the week ended Sept 12 reported by exporters for the following purchasing countries, in tonnes:</p>
<p>Net Sales:     1995/96		 1996/97</p>
<p> Australia	10,000		   Nil</p>
<p> Dominican Rep   9,800</p>
<p> Colombia	  7,700</p>
<p> Canada	    6,400</p>
<p> Unknown	 -90,000		102,000</p>
<p> China		 Nil		 50,000</p>
<p>Exports of 106,700 tonnes were down 2 percent from the previous week.</p>
<p>Primary export destinations: China, Philippines and Canada.</p>
</text>
